!Series_title = Transcriptome analysis to UHRF1 depletion in MUTU I cells
!Series_geo_accession = GSE136609
!Series_status = Public on May 04 2020
!Series_submission_date = Aug 29 2019
!Series_last_update_date = Sep 15 2020
!Series_pubmed_id = 32424339
!Series_summary = RNAseq was used to identify host and viral transcriptome changes in UHRF1 knock-out MUTU I cells.  UHRF1 KO MUTU I cells were subjected to FACSort for ICAM1+/GP350- and ICAM1-/GP350+ subpopulations, which were further used for RNAseq analysis. The MUTU I cells expressing control sgRNA was used as the control.
!Series_overall_design = UHRF1 KO MUTU I cells were subjected to FACSort for ICAM1+/GP350- and ICAM1-/GP350+ subpopulations, which were further used for RNAseq analysis. The MUTU I cells expressing control sgRNA was used as the control.
